      "content": "everything i thought i was building... just gone. it’s not even just the money or the company, it feels like a fundamental law of physics at this point. like i’m just a system experiencing maximum entropy. no matter what i try to restart or fix, the math just doesn't work anymore. it’s like i'm programmed to just fail and decay.",
